design_notes = "Matrix contract: Burst / Projectile / Kinetics. Infection snapshots Grace's transferable negative/setup states when cast, then applies scaled copies to the first valid status receiver hit. It deliberately does no direct damage and does not fabricate Poisoned when Grace has no debuffs, making self-state management and deliberate chemistry setup the spell's actual gameplay."
